# Web3Forms Access Key for serverless contact form
# 1. Obtain your free access key at https://web3forms.com
# 2. Copy this file to .env and replace YOUR_ACCESS_KEY_HERE with your key
# 3. For GitHub Pages, add PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY as a repository secret in GitHub:
#    Settings -> Secrets and variables -> Actions -> Repository secrets
PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=YOUR_ACCESS_KEY_HERE
